#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Choose %s by selecting them and then select the \"Choose\" arrow button."
msgstr "Tandai %s lalu klik tombol panah kanan untuk memilihnya."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Remove %s by selecting them and then select the \"Remove\" arrow button."
msgstr "Tandai %s lalu klik tombol panah kiri untuk mengeluarkannya."

#, javascript-format
msgid "Type into this box to filter down the list of selected %s."
msgstr "Ketik di kotak ini untuk menyaring daftar %s terpilih."

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Saring"

#, javascript-format
msgid "Choose selected %s"
msgstr "Pilih %s yang ditandai"

#, javascript-format
msgid "Remove selected %s"
msgstr "Keluarkan %s yang ditandai"

#, javascript-format
msgid "Remove all %s"
msgstr "Keluarkan semua %s"

msgid ""
"You have selected an action, and you haven’t made any changes on individual "
"fields. You’re probably looking for the Go button rather than the Save "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Anda telah memilih tindakan, dan Anda belum membuat perubahan apa pun di "
"setiap bidang. Anda mungkin mencari tombol Jalankan, bukan tombol Simpan."

msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "Minggu"

msgid "Friday"
msgstr "Jumat"

msgctxt "abbrev. day Sunday"
msgid "Sun"
msgstr "Min"
